== Mk-tier ladder mapping ==
The Psi Stabilizer preset is the
'''first''' of the wiki's Psi-Tech triad to ship on the HelmKit
substrate. Per the 7-step Mk-ladder canonical taxonomy:

* '''[[HelmKit Mk1.0]]''' ships the Stabilizer preset only — a
  baseline-locked steady reference field (bifilar coil, sub-MHz,
  ICNIRP-bounded).
* '''[[HelmKit Mk2.0]]''' upgrades the Stabilizer to its
  '''state-aware''' form — closed-loop stim envelope adapts to
  wearer EEG/HRV state in real time. This is the
  '''state-aware Stabilizer''' the wiki Stabilizer page actually
  describes.
* '''[[HelmKit Mk2.5]]''' adds matched-F² H1-vs-H2 mechanism
  comparison; Stabilizer preset runs on both arms.

